        <headline>Wind Advisory issued September 25 at 4:31AM EDT until September 27 at 6:00AM EDT by NWS Upton NY</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...North winds 20 to 25 mph with gusts up to 55 mph
expected.

* WHERE...Portions of southern Connecticut and southeast New
York.

* WHEN...From 2 PM Friday to 6 AM EDT Sunday.

* IMPACTS...Gusty winds will blow around unsecured objects. Tree
limbs could be blown down and a few power outages may result.
</description>
        <instruction>Winds this strong can make driving difficult, especially for high
profile vehicles. Use extra caution.

Secure outdoor objects.</instruction>
